    {
      "key": "notes",
      "source": "tropica",
      "sourceUrl": "https://tropica.com/en/plants/plantdetails/Linderniarotundifolia(045)/4468",
      "html": "<p>Lindernia rotundifolia 'Variegated' grows on sandy banks along streams in Asia. This marbled variant may grow new shoots with entirely green leaves. Cut these shoots off to maintain the marbled aspect. The plant is undemanding and quickly forms compact groups and may require some pruning.</p><p>Lindernia rotundifolia is suitable both for background and as a solitary mid-ground plant with leaves growing tightly from top to bottom. A good starter plant that thrives under most conditions.</p>"
    }
